    "reason": "The earlier JP unit import moved these units' fragments to the 872000006-872000016 item IDs. F_NV_EX_CLASS_UP_MST consumes those IDs, and the banners, shops and raid rewards grant them. F_SACRIFICE_MST still returned the original 2500xxxxx IDs, so converting a duplicate gave fragments its own EX awakening cannot use.",
